UID:aUhboCEND4kOgpiht-4vA
SUMMARY:HXD Week: Norton Rose Fulbright Lvl. 20 Reception Floor Tour
DTSTAMP:20260806T053915Z
DTSTART:20260806T160000Z
DESCRIPTION:Norton Rose Fulbright is a multi floor law firm located at 1550
	 Lamar St.\, Suite 2000. NRF workspace consists of eight (8) practice floo
	rs (lvl’s 18\, 20 thru 26) including two (2) reception/meeting room floors
	 and a two-floor interconnecting staircase as designed by Rottet Studio an
	d completed June 7th\, 2024.\n\nhttps://architecturehouston.org/event/hxd-
	week-norton-rose-fulbright-office-tour/\n\nFrom AIA Houston
URL:https://architecturehouston.org/event/hxd-week-norton-rose-fulbright-of
	fice-tour/
