DESCRIPTION:Join us at Levy Park with Taoist Healing for Tai Chi and Medita
	tion every Thursday at 6 pm and Friday at 9 am. Practice Tai Chi to connec
	t and focus the body and mind with slow\, low-impact gentle movements and 
