SUMMARY:A Year in the Wildlife Garden
DTSTAMP:20260806T053917Z
DTSTART:20260822T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:$22 member / $37 nonmemberAges 12+\, minors must be accompanied
	 by an adult \n\n\n\nWhat’s the best time to plant wildflowers\, put up a 
	birdhouse\, or clean up the garden after a freeze? With a little understan
	ding of nature’s rhythms\, you can plan your year to maximize wildlife ben
	efits and minimize your stress. In this class we’ll talk through a year in
	 the wildlife garden and send you home with a calendar of to-dos for each 
	season. \n\n\n\nPlease dress for the weather and wear walking shoes. \n\n\
	n\n\nregister online\n\nhttps://houstonarboretum.org/event/a-year-in-the-w
	ildlife-garden/\n\nFrom Houston Arboretum & Nature Center
URL:https://houstonarboretum.org/event/a-year-in-the-wildlife-garden/
