SUMMARY:Kids Nite Out
DTSTAMP:20260806T053917Z
DTSTART:20260822T180000Z
DESCRIPTION:Parents\, enjoy a night off—send your kids to the J for an even
	ing packed with swimming\, DJ kid-friendly tunes\, dancing and plenty of p
